"""Task-specific editorial synthesis; source papers are selected per partition."""
# Chinese focus, English focus, Chinese opportunity, English opportunity.
CONTENT={
'alpha_mining':('研究对象是可以复用、组合和检验的收益信号。公式生成、筛选与组合是不同环节，搜索到低相关信号并不自动证明它具有稳定的样本外预测能力。','The object is a reusable return signal. Formula discovery, selection and combination are distinct stages; finding a low-correlation signal does not establish stable out-of-sample predictability.','将新颖性、经济含义与样本外有效性分开检验，并研究不同市场状态下的因子更新机制。','Test novelty, economic interpretation and out-of-sample validity separately, and study signal updating across market regimes.'),
'time_series':('关注金融序列的时间结构、变量依赖、表示、补全与生成。通用序列方法的金融实验与专门的金融建模分别保存在 Application 和 Core；明确以资产价值为目标的预测另见估值预测。','This task concerns temporal structure, variable dependence, representation, reconstruction and generation. General sequence methods with financial experiments and finance-specific modeling are separated into Application and Core. Explicit asset-value targets also belong to valuation prediction.','研究跨频率、缺失和状态变化下的稳定性，避免将单一预测误差改善直接解释为投资收益。','Study stability across frequencies, missingness and regime changes without translating a forecast-error gain directly into investment profit.'),
'pricing':('关注风险溢价、公允价值和定价关系。衍生品数值求解、模型校准与经济定价因子属于不同问题；预测未来成交价格与估计无套利价值需要分别评价。','This task concerns risk premia, fair value and pricing relationships. Derivative solvers, calibration and economic pricing factors solve different problems; future-price prediction and no-arbitrage valuation need separate evaluation.','把数值精度、经济约束和真实交易可实现性共同纳入检验，明确模型假设的适用范围。','Evaluate numerical accuracy, economic constraints and trading feasibility together, while making model assumptions explicit.'),
'valuation_prediction':('预测目标包括资产价格、收益、波动率、企业价值及经营基本面。新闻、财报、市场序列和关系结构提供不同信息来源，目标与预测窗口必须明确。','Targets include asset prices, returns, volatility, enterprise value and business fundamentals. News, reports, market sequences and relational structure provide different information; targets and horizons must be explicit.','检验时间戳、公司身份和数据修订带来的泄漏，并区分预测准确率、资产排序与扣费后的经济效用。','Check leakage from timestamps, company identity and data revisions; separate prediction accuracy, asset ranking and economic value after costs.'),
'portfolio':('核心输出是资产集合、权重或再平衡方案。组合层面表现同时受到预测信号、约束、成本和配置算法影响，不能把全部收益归因于单个模块。','The output is an asset set, portfolio weights or a rebalancing plan. Performance depends jointly on signals, constraints, costs and allocation, so aggregate gains cannot be attributed to one module without controls.','在统一资产池、再平衡频率和成本假设下比较配置方法，考察极端行情与长期资金目标。','Compare allocation methods under matched universes, rebalancing frequencies and costs, including stressed markets and long-horizon objectives.'),
'financial_risk':('研究潜在损失、违约及风险传播。信用解释与反事实补救仍属于信用风险任务；存在故意欺诈或攻击时才转向金融安全。市场、流动性和系统性风险应分别定义事件与损失。','This task concerns potential losses, default and risk propagation. Credit explanations and recourse remain credit-risk tasks; deliberate fraud or attacks belong to financial safety. Market, liquidity and systemic risks require distinct events and loss definitions.','加强尾部事件、跨机构与跨期检验，把概率校准、拒贷成本和压力情景纳入统一决策评价。','Strengthen tail-event, cross-institution and temporal evaluation, integrating calibration, lending costs and stress scenarios into decision assessment.'),
'insurance':('以保险合同、保费、索赔、准备金及寿命风险为对象。客户营销、保险销售对话与欺诈检测分别与金融服务或金融安全关联，不因使用保险数据就视为精算贡献。','This task concerns insurance contracts, premiums, claims, reserves and longevity risk. Marketing, sales dialogue and fraud detection connect to services or safety; using insurance data alone does not establish an actuarial contribution.','联合考察长尾赔付、风险选择和长期校准，检验模型在保单结构与人群变化下的适用性。','Examine heavy-tailed claims, risk selection and long-term calibration, including changes in contract structure and insured populations.'),
'financial_sentiment':('目标是金融文本中的情感、语调、立场及其对象。公司、事件和方面粒度不同；情感预测与利用情感预测股票收益属于不同任务。','Targets are sentiment, tone, stance and their financial subjects. Company, event and aspect granularity differ; predicting sentiment and using sentiment to predict returns are distinct tasks.','研究标签口径、文化语言差异和跨期漂移，避免以市场收益倒推情感标签正确性。','Study annotation policy, cultural and language differences and temporal drift without treating market returns as proof of sentiment-label correctness.'),
'financial_qa':('围绕金融问题寻找证据并生成事实答案、数值答案或可执行推理。文本与表格联合推理、跨文档问答和多轮对话需要不同的证据对齐方式。','Financial QA finds evidence and produces factual answers, numerical answers or executable reasoning. Table-text reasoning, multi-document QA and dialogue require different forms of evidence alignment.','将答案正确性、数值单位、推理步骤和引用忠实性分别验证，研究拒答与不完整用户信息下的可靠性。','Verify answers, numerical units, reasoning steps and citation faithfulness separately, including abstention and underspecified user requests.'),
'financial_understanding':('关注事实、实体、关系、事件与文档结构的提取和解释，也包括有证据支持的摘要及报告生成。文档版面理解与金融语义理解需要分别识别。','This task extracts and interprets facts, entities, relations, events and document structure, including evidence-grounded summaries and reports. Layout understanding and financial semantics need separate treatment.','连接结构提取、数值一致性和跨文档事实核验，检验版式、语言和报告规则变化带来的影响。','Connect structural extraction, numerical consistency and cross-document verification, testing shifts in layouts, languages and reporting rules.'),
'financial_decision':('核心输出是买卖、执行、做市、对冲或业务行动。金融智能体的工具调用与市场仿真需要与实际决策结果相联系，组合权重配置单列为投资组合。','Outputs are trading, execution, quoting, hedging or business actions. Agent tool use and market simulation need to connect to decision outcomes; portfolio weight allocation has its own category.','用闭环实验和消融分离信息、推理、工具与执行贡献，纳入延迟、市场冲击和失败恢复。','Use closed-loop experiments and ablations to separate information, reasoning, tool and execution effects, including latency, market impact and recovery from failure.'),
'sustainable_finance':('关注可持续性信息如何进入融资、投资和风险分析。ESG 披露、漂绿识别、气候风险与责任投资的目标不同，不能用文本评分替代实际环境或社会效果。','This task studies how sustainability information enters financing, investment and risk analysis. ESG disclosure, greenwashing, climate risk and responsible investment have different targets; text scores do not substitute for environmental or social outcomes.','建立可追溯披露证据与跨期评价，区分行业暴露、报告质量和真实可持续性变化。','Build traceable disclosure evidence and longitudinal evaluation, distinguishing sector exposure, report quality and actual sustainability changes.'),
'financial_services':('关注客户交互、产品匹配、个人财务服务及银行支付流程。服务质量、业务效率与金融结果需要分别评价；违约预测和欺诈检测按风险或安全任务归类。','This task concerns customer interaction, product matching, personal finance and banking/payment workflows. Service quality, efficiency and financial outcomes require separate evaluation; default and fraud prediction belong to risk or safety.','研究服务可及性、长期客户利益与跨机构迁移，区分公开数据实验和真实业务部署。','Study access, long-term customer interests and transfer across institutions, distinguishing public-data experiments from deployment.'),
'blockchain':('以链上交易、账户、智能合约、代币及 DeFi 机制为对象。区块链背景与具体金融任务允许交叉标注；数字资产价格预测、攻击检测与机制研究分别确定主方向。','Objects include on-chain transactions, accounts, contracts, tokens and DeFi mechanisms. Blockchain context can overlap with a financial task; price forecasting, attack detection and mechanism analysis have distinct primary tasks.','检验跨链、跨协议和时间变化下的泛化，把链上成本与可观察信息边界纳入评价。','Test transfer across chains, protocols and time, accounting for on-chain costs and limits of observable information.'),
'financial_safety':('关注恶意行为、违规、隐私泄露和攻击造成的损害。欺诈与正常信用违约需要分开；一般公平性或反事实解释若服务于信用评分，主方向仍是金融风险。','This task concerns malicious behavior, violations, privacy leakage and attacks. Fraud differs from ordinary credit default; fairness or recourse for credit scoring keeps financial risk as its primary task.','加强误报成本、攻击适应性、延迟标签和真实业务分布检验，明确隐私与安全保障的假设。','Evaluate false-positive costs, adaptive attacks, delayed labels and operational distributions, with explicit assumptions behind privacy and safety guarantees.'),
'financial_ir':('主要贡献是金融证据的表示、搜索、过滤或排序。RAG 的检索模块与最终问答结果分别评价；检索输入可为文本、表格、图表或数值向量。','The main contribution represents, searches, filters or ranks financial evidence. RAG retrieval and final QA need separate evaluation; inputs may be text, tables, charts or numerical vectors.','研究时间有效性、跨文档覆盖和数值敏感性，分析证据缺失、召回失败与生成错误各自的影响。','Study temporal validity, cross-document coverage and numerical sensitivity, separating missing evidence, retrieval failure and generation errors.'),
'financial_evaluation':('主要贡献是数据集、基准、评测环境、协议或能力诊断。任务覆盖、数据构建和评测设计是研究对象；论文仅使用现有基准不会自动归到本类。','The main contribution is a dataset, benchmark, evaluation environment, protocol or capability audit. Coverage, construction and evaluation design are research objects; merely using an existing benchmark is insufficient.','检查污染、标注、用户场景和预算敏感性，研究静态得分与实际金融工作表现之间的联系。','Check contamination, annotation, user scenarios and budget sensitivity, and study the connection between static scores and financial work.'),
'financial_models':('关注可复用的金融领域模型及其预训练、后训练和适配。金融是通用适配方法的实验领域时归 Application；只在单个任务中调用 LLM 不构成金融模型贡献。','This task concerns reusable financial models and their pretraining, post-training and adaptation. Finance as one domain of a general adaptation method belongs to Application; calling an LLM for one task is insufficient.','核对金融语料时间边界、能力保持和跨任务迁移，分离模型规模、数据、训练预算及检索的贡献。','Audit financial-corpus time boundaries, capability retention and cross-task transfer, separating scale, data, training budget and retrieval effects.'),
}
